{#- A team, role or person proposed at an event, or the owner's decision on it · Events.
    Sender: EventPlan\Teams (tellOwners: to each owner but the proposer; tellProposer: to the lead).
    Variables: first_name, place (the event's title), what ("The role Hospitality lead",
    "ada@x.test as Hospitality lead"), state —
      'proposed' a lead proposed it and an owner decides it
      'approved' the owner approved it as proposed
      'changed'  the owner approved it with different permissions
      'refused'  the owner refused it
    by (who proposed or decided), reason (the decider's, '' when proposing), action_url, action_label.
    Only what the code does: nothing gives anybody access until an owner who did not propose it
    approves it (Teams::decide), and an approved person is then told separately (Emails 'role'). -#}
{% extends 'emails/_layout.html.twig' %}
{% block category %}Events{% endblock %}
{% block hero %}illo-shield{% endblock %}
{% block why %}{{ state == 'proposed' ? 'You own an Africa GATES event, and its lead proposed a change to its team.' : 'You proposed a change to an Africa GATES event’s team.' }}{% endblock %}
{% block subject %}{{ state == 'proposed' ? 'To decide: ' ~ what ~ ' at ' ~ place : what ~ ' was ' ~ (state == 'changed' ? 'approved with changes' : state) ~ ' at ' ~ place }}{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}{{ state == 'proposed' ? by ~ ' proposed it. Nothing changes until an owner decides.' : 'Decided by ' ~ by ~ '. Their reason is inside.' }}{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{%- import 'emails/_blocks.html.twig' as b -%}
{{ b.eyebrow(place) }}
{{ b.h1(state == 'proposed' ? 'Something to decide, ' ~ first_name : 'Decided, ' ~ first_name) }}
{% if state == 'proposed' %}
{{ b.p(by ~ ' proposed ' ~ what ~ '. Nothing gives anybody access until an owner approves it, and you can change its permissions before you do.') }}
{% elseif state == 'refused' %}
{{ b.p(by ~ ' refused ' ~ what ~ '. Nothing changed at the event.') }}
{% elseif state == 'changed' %}
{{ b.p(by ~ ' approved ' ~ what ~ ', with different permissions from the ones you proposed. Team & roles shows both.') }}
{% else %}
{{ b.p(by ~ ' approved ' ~ what ~ '.') }}
{% endif %}
{{ b.facts([['Event', place], ['About', what]]|merge(reason ? [['Reason', reason]] : [])) }}
{{ b.button(action_label, action_url) }}
{{ b.note('Every decision is recorded with who made it and why.') }}
{% endblock %}
